    "note": "Amended 2019-08-30; Senate (30-10) and Assembly concurrence (57-18) votes were on this text; the first Assembly vote (54-17) was on the 2019-04-04 text. California double-amends: Sections 1, 3, 5 (old 18150/18170/18190, inoperative Sept. 1, 2020) are replaced by Sections 2, 4, 6 (operative Sept. 1, 2020, quoted). Section 4.5 adds an alternative 18170 operative only if AB 12 is also enacted and this bill is enacted last; it says the order lasts 'for a period of time between one to five years' instead of one year. The 08-30 amendment struck 'the school administration staff' and replaced it with 'a school administrator or a school administration staff member with a supervisorial role'. Renewal text for (D) and (E) of 18190 is not quoted."
